			repeating 0b0110 0110 pattern in the entire TCM1k signal,
			which excludes the Frame Alignment overhead and the
			OTUk overhead.
			-----------------------------
			ommp401InterfaceNumber:
			1 to 4 - CLIENT-1 to CLIENT-4
			-----------------------------
			Values :
			If Alarm is Present - Date and Time Stamp
				    eg:2017-5-18,9:47:20.0,+5:30
			If Alarm is Absent  - 0
			-----------------------------"
		::= { ommp401AlarmQueryEntry 74 }

